  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIs there a particular reason why `select fallback button text` is a div element?\nIt feels a bit strange that it has `display: block` while `<button>` has `display: content` and `<selectedcontent>`  has `display: inline`.\nI would have expected maybe a span?",
